window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Alive. Fighting. Desperate.</b></p> <p>When I died, the shifters' humanity died with me.</p> <p>Even though Tuslan managed to bring me back only seconds after the darkness consumed me, he and the others still went savage.</p> <p>Now I have to figure out a way to bind myself and my magic back to everyone in Tendira—including the shifters who legitimately killed me.</p> <p>It won't be easy, but at least Tuslan's with me. In his furry form.</p> <p>Being human has never sucked like this before… but it gives me a way to save everyone I love. I may be human, but there's not a chance I'll let Tendira fall without a fight.</p> <p>Beasts be with me because I'm going to need all the help I can get.</p>"; 
